      "description" : "Creates a new AI agent in the system with customizable attributes such as name, model configuration, behavior, and capabilities. This operation initializes the agent with the provided settings, enabling it to interact, respond, and perform tasks based on defined parameters like tone, guardrails, and optional web search support.\n\nInput Parameters:\nagentID (string): Unique identifier for the agent (optional or system-generated in some cases).\nagentName (string): Name of the agent.\nLLMKey (string): Identifier for the language model configuration used by the agent.\ndescription (string): Brief description of the agent’s purpose or functionality.\ntitle (string): Display title for the agent.\nicon (string): Icon or visual representation associated with the agent.\ntone (string): Defines the communication style of the agent (e.g., formal, casual).\nguardrail (string): Rules or constraints that control the agent’s behavior and responses.\nwebSearch (boolean): Enables or disables web search capability for the agent.\nprops (object): Additional custom properties or configurations for the agent.\n\nOutput Parameters:\nagentID (string): Unique identifier of the created agent.\nstatus (string): Status of the operation (e.g., success or failure).\nerror (string): Error message in case the operation fails."
    },
